{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "一条消息过河",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 122.72,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "跨链桥，是在两条链之间转移资产或消息的系统。",
   "spoken": "跨链桥，是在两条链之间转移资产或消息的系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 8.173
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "B 链上的合约，要相信 A 链上发生了某件事。",
   "spoken": "B 链上的合约，要相信 A 链上发生了某件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.216,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 9.314,
   "speechEnd": 12.802
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "可 B 链看不到 A 链。它只能相信某种证明。",
   "spoken": "可 B 链看不到 A 链。它只能相信某种证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.852,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 13.95,
   "speechEnd": 17.423
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "最常见的做法，叫锁定和铸造。",
   "spoken": "最常见的做法，叫锁定和铸造。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.488,
   "dur": 3.672,
   "speechStart": 18.586,
   "speechEnd": 21.324
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "举个例子。用户在 A 链，把 100 USDT 存进桥合约，锁起来。",
   "spoken": "举个例子。用户在 A 链，把 100 USDT 存进桥合约，锁起来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 22.38,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 22.478,
   "speechEnd": 27.761
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "桥合约发出一条存款事件，写着用户、金额和一个序号。",
   "spoken": "桥合约发出一条存款事件，写着用户、金额和一个序号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.816,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 28.914,
   "speechEnd": 33.592
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "中继者观察 A 链，等这笔交易足够确定，不会再被回滚。",
   "spoken": "中继者观察 A 链，等这笔交易足够确定，不会再被回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 34.652,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 34.75,
   "speechEnd": 38.845
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "然后把消息和证明，一起送到 B 链。",
   "spoken": "然后把消息和证明，一起送到 B 链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.888,
   "dur": 3.912,
   "speechStart": 39.986,
   "speechEnd": 42.974
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "证明可以是一组签名，一条 Merkle 证明，或者一份零知识证明。",
   "spoken": "证明可以是一组签名，一条 Merkle 证明，或者一份零知识证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 44.02,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 44.118,
   "speechEnd": 48.689
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "B 链的桥合约验证证明，再检查这个序号没有用过。",
   "spoken": "B 链的桥合约验证证明，再检查这个序号没有用过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 49.76,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 49.858,
   "speechEnd": 53.762
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "都通过了，才给用户铸造 100 枚映射 USDT。",
   "spoken": "都通过了，才给用户铸造 100 枚映射 USDT。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 54.804,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 54.902,
   "speechEnd": 58.794
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "注意中间这一段。",
   "spoken": "注意中间这一段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 59.848,
   "dur": 2.064,
   "speechStart": 59.946,
   "speechEnd": 61.077
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "从 A 链到 B 链，是信任边界。B 链判断真假，只能靠这一步验证。",
   "spoken": "从 A 链到 B 链，是信任边界。B 链判断真假，只能靠这一步验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 62.132,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 62.23,
   "speechEnd": 68.072
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "验证要同时查三件事。",
   "spoken": "验证要同时查三件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 69.144,
   "dur": 2.856,
   "speechStart": 69.242,
   "speechEnd": 71.17
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "证明是有效的。消息没有被处理过。消息来自正确的源链和源合约。",
   "spoken": "证明是有效的。消息没有被楚理过。消息来自正确的源链和源合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 72.22,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 72.318,
   "speechEnd": 78.125
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 79.184,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 79.282,
   "speechEnd": 80.067
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "A 城的银行收下你的金条，开一张提货单。你拿着它，到 B 城银行兑换等值的金券。",
   "spoken": "A 城的银航收下你的金条，开一张提货单。你拿着它，到 B 城银航兑换等值的金券。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 81.276,
   "dur": 7.368,
   "speechStart": 81.374,
   "speechEnd": 87.788
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "B 城银行看不到 A 城的账本，只能看提货单上的签章。",
   "spoken": "B 城银航看不到 A 城的账本，只能看提货单上的签章。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 88.864,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 88.962,
   "speechEnd": 92.759
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "印章被偷，或者核对方法有漏洞，B 城银行就会兑出不存在的金子。",
   "spoken": "印章被偷，或者核对方法有漏洞，B 城银航就会兑出不存在的金子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 93.812,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 93.91,
   "speechEnd": 98.85
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，两座银行的金库加起来，往往是整个系统里最大的一笔钱。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，两座银航的金库加起来，往往是整个系统里最大的一笔钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 99.912,
   "dur": 6.648,
   "speechStart": 100.01,
   "speechEnd": 105.736
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "所以跨链桥，是攻击者的首选目标。",
   "spoken": "所以跨链桥，是攻击者的首选目标。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 106.78,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 106.878,
   "speechEnd": 109.985
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "反过来走，销毁映射代币、解锁原来的资产，风险一样，金额往往更大。",
   "spoken": "反过来走，销毁映射代币、解锁原来的资产，风险一样，金额往往更大。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 111.056,
   "dur": 7.104,
   "speechStart": 111.154,
   "speechEnd": 117.32
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "那么，B 链到底该相信谁？",
   "spoken": "那么，B 链到底该相信谁？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 118.38,
   "dur": 3.144,
   "speechStart": 118.478,
   "speechEnd": 120.692
  }
